procrun — third-party attribution

src/vfork_spawn.zig ports, re-expressed in Zig, the structure of the child
side of musl 1.2.5's posix_spawn (src/process/posix_spawn.c, function
`child`: reset every signal with a handler to SIG_DFL while memory is shared,
credentials, file actions, restore the signal mask, exec, report the error on
a CLOEXEC pipe) and its clone(CLONE_VM | CLONE_VFORK) parent protocol.
SOURCE (algorithm port, not a line-for-line copy). The rest of the module is
the zig-libs authors' own.

